                            	  2232: __far_z_04_0017:
02:0003AA44 61000592        	  2233:     jsr     UpdateBurrower
                            	  2234:     ; If zora died in the call above, then it happened while in
                            	  2235:     ; states 2, 3, or 4. In the code below, the state won't be 0.
                            	  2236:     ; So, it won't flag the zora inactive. This is why the zora does
                            	  2237:     ; not come back after killing it.
                            	  2238:     ;
