                            	  4046:     even
                            	  4047: _L_z04_PondFairy_HandleOtherStates_CheckState2:
                            	  4048:     ; If state <> 2 (so, it's 3), then return.
                            	  4049:     ;
                            	  4050:     ; Note that the first time here is when we fall thru from 8DBC.
                            	  4051:     ; In this case, A has $50 -- the value that Link's object timer
                            	  4052:     ; was set to, and we'll return.
