02:0003CC3A 0003CC4E        	  6950:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003CC3E 0003CC4E        	  6951:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
