02:0003F688 610000B2        	 12704:     jsr     Ganon_GetCurCloudRight
02:0003F68C 619A            	 12705:     jsr     Ganon_DrawCloud
02:0003F68E 610000A6        	 12706:     jsr     Ganon_GetCurCloudLeft
